  "assessment": {
    "art": "All 56 epic primary masks are unique and each differs materially from its corresponding rare beyond palette or outline changes: 24–83 changed occupied coordinates, with intersection/union 0.1684–0.7108. Source contains authored forks, hooks, antlers, crescents, coils, claws, crowns and relic motifs rather than relying on a rarity recolor.",
    "bounds": "Every icon is a valid 16×16 single frame; all primary pixels lie within x/y 1..14, leaving space for the cardinal outline within the 16×16 canvas. This verifies source icon bounds, not final held-prop visibility.",
    "gripAndComposition": "Existing equipment fitting, hand placement, mirroring, draw order, composite dimensions and bounded caches remain unchanged. Epic weapons retain a common lower grip. Large new ornamentation still requires actual 2× held-view inspection.",
    "faceFix": "The second idle pose moves head row 5 to row 6. Extending protected body rows from y<=5 to y<6+Number(pose===1) protects that extra row only for the bobbing pose. Earlier regression evidence records 1328 occlusions; the added test compares actual composed head pixel colors across compatible epic weapons, heroes, poses and both facings using heroEquipmentPose.",
    "iconPreservation": "168 non-epic icons are byte-equivalent as serialized sprite objects to the preserved baseline. Their combined SHA256 is 6450b9b126485c4251fa4dd55963ff6f1e47d388f67bbfc8ca7b6c5eaf4960db.",
    "lowerRarityCompositionLimit": "The face fix applies to equipment of every rarity. Exact preservation applies to the 168 icons, not to every lower-rarity equipped hero composite; restoring the bobbing head can intentionally change those composites.",
    "uiAndEconomy": "All 22 previously tracked src/core files are unchanged. Widget HUD/game/index, menu economy/equipment/index and menu CSS match prior source bindings. Epic rarity UI token #de8aff is unchanged; new internal jewel colors do not replace the UI rarity token.",
    "tests": "Two meaningful tests are additive: a captured full-object fingerprint for all 168 non-epic icons, and final head-pixel preservation. Cache golden changes retain 57960 equipped views and 3840 fever/KO cases with unchanged iteration logic and assertions; only documented expected digests/title/comments change for the requested art and head fix. Preserved mismatch log records exactly the new expected digests.",
    "hostGateEvidence": "Canonical log records 88 test files / 1202 tests passing, then lint and all typecheck commands; journal records the exact canonical command exiting 0 at the Host source freeze. The reviewer did not rerun these gates."
  },
  "followUpVisualFocus": [
    "Verify all 56 epic icons and the 32 held weapon silhouettes on native dark and light backgrounds at actual 2× scale.",
    "Inspect gauntlet epic 1 and greatsword epic 3 closely: they have some of the highest overlap with paired rare primary masks, despite verified shape changes.",
    "Inspect broad crowns, wings, antlers and hooked tips for preserved recognition after fitting, body occlusion, attack rotation and mirroring.",
    "Confirm bobbing face visibility, hand contact and clipping in actual native composites; quantitative icon differences alone do not establish aesthetic quality."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "This artifact approves the reviewed source snapshot only; native visual approval is explicitly pending.",
    "Primary occupancy comparisons establish substantial geometry change but cannot establish attractive or readable motifs at actual display size.",
    "The prior release's long performance observation belongs to its prior frozen source and packages; this review does not transfer that result to the new art.",
    "Packaging, Windows hardware behavior, human enjoyment and deployment are outside this source review."
  ]
}
